# (cNextItem), aim at HookPoint2 (re-enabled by Toits01.SetGoalComplete(99) at ~154.5), short
# fire press attaches (HookLength locks at the standing distance), walk east off the roof edge
# - the taut-rope constraint (PlayerWalking.ProcessMove 0x0237) arrests the fall (VM-owned
# while bHooked and PHYS_Falling) - then ALTFIRE pays the rope out and the pendulum lowers
# toward the street below the anchor; the use key detaches on the street.
t=155.50 next_item
t=158.40 forward 0
t=158.50 track HookPoint2
t=159.30 fire_hold 1
t=159.50 fire_hold 0
t=159.70 goto -2700 1080
