# pursuit flank put his muzzle on the player side (DTGunned 75 at 342.1 and a
# 74-dmg series through the generator phase killed the route player; measured
# local/re/item69/toits01-retiming-v1.txt). Duel him at long range instead, from
# the landing spot, before closing on the door line. His one unavoidable hit is
# soldier18's in-flight rocket: three dodge retimings (none, one juke, two jukes
# under local/re/item69/toits01-retiming-v2/-v3/-v4.txt) all took the 318.8 blast
# (50/45/41 hp), so the route eats it once and duels from range where v3 measured
# zero returning DTGunned hits.
t=381.60 engage BaseSoldier17 3500 20 period=1.4
